<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA-MAY PPI 0.2 PCT DOWN MO/MO, UP 7.1 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA-MAY PPI 0.2 PCT DOWN MO/MO, UP 7.1 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's producer price</p>
<p>index fell 0.2 percent in May for a year-on-year increase of</p>
<p>7.1 percent, the country's statistics department said on</p>
<p>Tuesday.</p>
<p>    LITHUANIAN PPI		  May 97    April 97   May 96</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change (pct) -0.2	-1.1	 -0.4</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change (pct)   +7.1	+6.8	 +19.9</p>
<p>-- Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17 . 10</p>
</text>
